866
00:41:06,630 --> 00:41:08,160
My dad gave it to me.

867
00:41:10,710 --> 00:41:11,440
Dad,

868
00:41:11,440 --> 00:41:13,700
they want to take my gold longevity lock.

869
00:41:14,480 --> 00:41:15,810
Department Chief Wang.

870
00:41:16,980 --> 00:41:18,060
Why are you here?

871
00:41:19,000 --> 00:41:20,200
Go find your grandma.

872
00:41:24,150 --> 00:41:25,920
Where did that gold longevity lock
come from?

873
00:41:25,920 --> 00:41:27,880
What does it matter where it came from?

874
00:41:27,880 --> 00:41:28,520
I bought my child

875
00:41:28,520 --> 00:41:29,400
a little trinket.

876
00:41:29,400 --> 00:41:30,790
Is it any of your business?

877
00:41:30,790 --> 00:41:31,840
That gold longevity lock
was left by my grandmother

878
00:41:31,840 --> 00:41:32,790
to my mother.

879
00:41:32,790 --> 00:41:34,750
It has the character "Ying"
engraved on the back.

880
00:41:34,750 --> 00:41:36,880
That belongs to my mom, Zhang Wenying.

881
00:41:37,110 --> 00:41:38,440
So what if it's engraved?

882
00:41:38,440 --> 00:41:39,560
Does an engraving make it yours?

883
00:41:39,560 --> 00:41:40,420
I could also say

884
00:41:40,440 --> 00:41:41,840
when I bought it for my child,

885
00:41:41,840 --> 00:41:43,470
I deliberately engraved
the character "Ying."

886
00:41:43,470 --> 00:41:44,840
Maybe in the future,
I'll even give my child

887
00:41:44,840 --> 00:41:46,310
a nickname like Ying.

888
00:41:46,310 --> 00:41:47,110
Wang Pengju.

889
00:41:47,360 --> 00:41:49,400
When I was transferred for work back then,

890
00:41:49,400 --> 00:41:50,920
my mom gave this gold longevity lock

891
00:41:50,920 --> 00:41:51,920
to Wan Yang.

892
00:41:52,480 --> 00:41:53,790
Later, I heard from my mom

893
00:41:53,790 --> 00:41:55,400
that Wan Yang passed
the gold longevity lock

894
00:41:55,400 --> 00:41:56,590
on to Sun Jie.

895
00:41:57,360 --> 00:41:58,110
No matter what,

896
00:41:58,110 --> 00:41:58,960
there is no reason
for this gold longevity lock

897
00:41:58,960 --> 00:42:00,150
to appear here with you.

898
00:42:00,150 --> 00:42:01,810
I'm warning you, Wang Pengju,

899
00:42:01,920 --> 00:42:04,150
whether this gold longevity lock
was stolen or robbed,

900
00:42:04,150 --> 00:42:05,950
you'd better confess honestly.

901
00:42:07,270 --> 00:42:08,530
Not going to talk, huh?

902
00:42:09,110 --> 00:42:10,560
Explain it at the police station!

903
00:42:10,560 --> 00:42:11,140
What are you doing?

904
00:42:11,140 --> 00:42:11,920
-What are you doing?
-Let's go!

905
00:42:11,920 --> 00:42:12,670
I... I picked it up!

906
00:42:12,670 --> 00:42:13,670
I picked it up!

907
00:42:13,700 --> 00:42:14,700
I picked it up, okay?
